# Generated build outputs (regenerated by CMake; see commit_pin.txt for the
# exact configure command). Source under . (CMakeLists.txt, *.mk, dnn/, celt/,
# silk/, src/, include/, cmake/) is committed; build/ is not.
build/

# The repo-root .gitignore's standard VS "build results" patterns (x64/, x86/,
# [Aa][Rr][Mm]/, [Aa][Rr][Mm]64/) blanket-match any directory with those names
# anywhere in the tree -- including opus's own upstream SIMD source directory
# convention (silk/x86/, celt/arm/, dnn/x86/, etc.), which are real vendored
# source, not build output. This is almost certainly why sv1eia/Thetis-RADE's
# own vendored copy is missing them (opus_dnn/commit_pin.txt's "vendored_subset"
# lists them as intended, but they silently never landed) -- not a considered
# decision, a gitignore footgun. Un-ignore them explicitly here.
!/silk/x86/
!/silk/x86/**
!/silk/arm/
!/silk/arm/**
!/silk/fixed/x86/
!/silk/fixed/x86/**
!/silk/fixed/arm/
!/silk/fixed/arm/**
!/silk/float/x86/
!/silk/float/x86/**
!/celt/x86/
!/celt/x86/**
!/celt/arm/
!/celt/arm/**
!/dnn/x86/
!/dnn/x86/**
!/dnn/arm/
!/dnn/arm/**
